# api/ holds the Vercel serverless bundle. It is intentionally NOT ignored
# here: Vercel collects the post-build output through this ignore list, and
# ignoring it stripped the function from Git-connected deployments. Local-only
# exclusion lives in .git/info/exclude so the artifact is never committed.
